WEBVTT

00:00:02.190 --> 00:00:05.330
I wonder what it will be?

00:00:05.330 --> 00:00:07.290
This week, it's this!

00:00:08.700 --> 00:00:11.150
The attack points change every turn.

00:00:11.150 --> 00:00:14.710
It can bring out a Fortune 
Lady when it leaves the field.

00:00:17.720 --> 00:00:19.500
Director Godwin!

00:00:19.950 --> 00:00:22.610
No way!  Director Godwin is…

00:00:22.610 --> 00:00:23.990
What are you doing?

00:00:24.950 --> 00:00:25.800
Divine!

00:00:25.800 --> 00:00:27.440
Just like I thought.

00:00:27.710 --> 00:00:30.100
A rat sneaked in.

00:00:31.280 --> 00:00:34.010
I thought you were working 
under Godwin's orders, but

00:00:34.010 --> 00:00:37.010
by the surprised look on your 
face, I must be mistaken.

00:00:37.200 --> 00:00:41.080
However, I can't let you leave 
after what you saw here.

00:00:47.600 --> 00:00:51.290
If you keep doing this, 
Security will investigate you.

00:00:51.640 --> 00:00:56.130
Don't worry.  You'll be treated 
as an accidental death.

00:00:56.130 --> 00:00:59.340
The Public Maintenance 
Department can't touch us.

00:00:59.340 --> 00:01:02.800
As long as I know Godwin's secret.

00:01:02.800 --> 00:01:04.850
Director Godwin's secret?

00:01:05.170 --> 00:01:10.460
They say that he created Satellite, 
but that's a total lie.

00:01:11.570 --> 00:01:16.170
When Satellite was created, 
he was stuck inside.

00:01:17.130 --> 00:01:20.400
He's actually from Satellite.

00:01:20.880 --> 00:01:22.130
What?

00:01:22.740 --> 00:01:24.250
Goodbye.

00:01:24.250 --> 00:01:26.300
Go, Psychic Commander!

00:01:36.160 --> 00:01:38.370
I see death.

00:01:38.850 --> 00:01:40.340
No… way…

00:01:56.950 --> 00:02:01.690
Looking over a vast distance

00:02:01.950 --> 00:02:06.790
I realized my field of vision was narrow

00:02:07.060 --> 00:02:11.700
Even if it’s easier to throw myself away

00:02:12.060 --> 00:02:16.470
I want to survive to the best of my abilities

00:02:18.330 --> 00:02:21.830
No matter how bad today is

00:02:23.410 --> 00:02:26.820
There’s still the faintest light

00:02:28.580 --> 00:02:32.220
All I have to do tomorrow

00:02:32.510 --> 00:02:36.280
Is light it myself

00:02:36.590 --> 00:02:41.290
I test myself so I won’t stop or vanish

00:02:41.660 --> 00:02:46.260
Even if I get countless scars

00:02:46.760 --> 00:02:52.560
I ride wishing for the 
arrival of a true tomorrow

00:02:52.870 --> 00:02:56.540
Today will never exist again

00:02:56.870 --> 00:03:02.440
So I won’t stop or vanish

00:03:26.070 --> 00:03:31.990
Resurrected Soul
Burning New Geoglyph

00:03:33.870 --> 00:03:35.550
No… way…

00:03:36.740 --> 00:03:42.350
Jack…

00:03:45.920 --> 00:03:47.220
Jack!

00:04:03.170 --> 00:04:05.140
What a pathetic girl.

00:04:24.780 --> 00:04:27.840
Carly, it's time.

00:04:28.850 --> 00:04:30.420
Is it an earthquake?

00:04:47.910 --> 00:04:49.290
What is it?

00:04:50.410 --> 00:04:51.230
Lua!

00:04:53.600 --> 00:04:55.330
It's a big one!

00:04:56.100 --> 00:04:57.900
Hey, open up!

00:05:13.560 --> 00:05:15.050
What's happening?

00:05:23.080 --> 00:05:24.780
Everyone, get to safety!

00:05:25.180 --> 00:05:26.670
Hurry up and leave!

00:05:30.180 --> 00:05:32.250
What are you doing?  Hurry up and leave!

00:05:33.530 --> 00:05:37.220
Divine, I won't forgive you.

00:05:38.120 --> 00:05:39.530
Who are you?

00:05:44.400 --> 00:05:45.490
You're…

00:05:45.890 --> 00:05:50.140
That's impossible.  There's no way 
you could've survived that fall.

00:05:51.390 --> 00:05:55.750
Divine, I have resurrected 
in order to bury you.

00:05:56.200 --> 00:05:57.450
What?

00:05:59.950 --> 00:06:01.820
This mark is pulsating.

00:06:02.040 --> 00:06:05.940
It wants your tarnished soul as a sacrifice.

00:06:06.970 --> 00:06:10.290
Accept my Shadow Duel.

00:06:11.460 --> 00:06:13.240
Shadow Duel?

00:06:19.140 --> 00:06:20.070
What?

00:06:36.340 --> 00:06:40.130
I don't know how you survived, but you must

00:06:40.130 --> 00:06:44.130
have a death wish if you're 
challenging me to a duel.

00:06:44.530 --> 00:06:49.050
Keep talking, Divine!  It won't 
be the same as last time.

00:06:49.050 --> 00:06:55.080
I'll send you and your desires 
into a world of shadows!

00:06:55.080 --> 00:06:57.290
You're talking nonsense!

00:06:57.290 --> 00:07:00.980
Fine.  I accept your duel!

00:07:00.980 --> 00:07:04.330
Taste my psychic dueling powers again!

00:07:07.740 --> 00:07:08.770
Duel!

00:07:09.700 --> 00:07:11.060
I go first!

00:07:12.440 --> 00:07:14.040
I summon Krebons!

00:07:19.970 --> 00:07:24.750
Next, I activate the Quick-Play Spell 
Emergency Teleport from my hand!

00:07:25.330 --> 00:07:32.650
I can Special Summon a Level 3-or-below 
Psychic-Type monster from my hand or deck!

00:07:32.650 --> 00:07:34.830
Come, Mind Protector!

00:07:37.510 --> 00:07:42.270
Level 2 Krebons tunes Level 3 Mind Protector!

00:07:42.570 --> 00:07:49.740
The flames of hate burn from the depths of 
my soul!  Dark anger will overwhelm the world!

00:07:50.000 --> 00:07:51.200
Synchro Summon!

00:07:51.440 --> 00:07:54.280
Appear, Magical Android!

00:07:56.840 --> 00:07:59.520
The first player can't 
attack on the first turn.

00:07:59.520 --> 00:08:04.360
However, Magical Android's effect 
activates during my End Phase!

00:08:04.360 --> 00:08:07.490
With Magical Android, during my 
End Phase, I gain life points

00:08:07.490 --> 00:08:11.190
equal to the number of my Psychic-Type 
monsters multiplied by 600!

00:08:11.460 --> 00:08:13.850
I have one Psychic-Type monster on my field!

00:08:13.850 --> 00:08:17.200
Therefore, I gain 600 life points.

00:08:19.140 --> 00:08:21.000
I end my turn.

00:08:21.400 --> 00:08:22.460
My turn!

00:08:23.420 --> 00:08:27.730
I activate the Field Spell 
Future Visions from my hand.

00:08:33.230 --> 00:08:34.320
Future Visions?

00:08:34.530 --> 00:08:38.570
That's right.  My duel will tell your future.

00:08:39.800 --> 00:08:41.980
Just when I thought that you're being spooky,

00:08:41.980 --> 00:08:44.980
you're using the same 
fortune-telling deck as always.

00:08:45.470 --> 00:08:50.450
Sorry, but your lame attempts 
to trick me won't work.

00:08:50.750 --> 00:08:55.320
No one controls my future!  
Not even destiny itself!

00:08:55.440 --> 00:09:00.160
Then try to escape the 
destiny that I foretold!

00:09:00.160 --> 00:09:03.110
I summon Fortune Lady Light!

00:09:05.440 --> 00:09:08.960
Fortune Lady's Level increases by 
one during every Standby Phase.

00:09:09.220 --> 00:09:14.380
This card's attack and defense points are 
equal to its Level multiplied by 200.

00:09:14.580 --> 00:09:18.220
On the turn that Fortune Lady 
Light is summoned, its Level is 1!

00:09:18.310 --> 00:09:20.670
That means it has 200 attack points!

00:09:21.020 --> 00:09:24.420
Then I activate the Field 
Spell Future Visions's effect!

00:09:24.780 --> 00:09:28.590
I send my summoned monster into 
the future until my next turn!

00:09:30.380 --> 00:09:33.370
Your fortune-telling has started.

00:09:34.830 --> 00:09:38.650
You summoned a monster, 
but you got rid of it?

00:09:38.650 --> 00:09:40.920
Your field is wide open.

00:09:41.150 --> 00:09:44.520
That's fine.  Destiny is already determined.

00:09:44.950 --> 00:09:48.340
Fortune Lady Light's effect now activates!

00:09:48.830 --> 00:09:54.850
When this card leaves the field, I can 
Special Summon a new Fortune Lady from my deck!

00:09:55.420 --> 00:09:58.200
Appear, Fortune Lady Fire!

00:10:01.550 --> 00:10:03.890
Fortune Lady Fire's Level is 2.

00:10:03.890 --> 00:10:07.160
Therefore, it has 400 
attack points this turn!

00:10:09.780 --> 00:10:16.160
My Magical Android has 2400 attack points.  
Your weakling is no match against it.

00:10:16.430 --> 00:10:20.250
It's more than enough because 
your power is just for show.

00:10:20.570 --> 00:10:23.020
Fortune Lady Fire's effect activates!

00:10:23.580 --> 00:10:28.780
When this card is successfully Special 
Summoned in attack position, one of the

00:10:28.780 --> 00:10:33.780
monsters on your field is destroyed, and you 
take damage equal to that monster's attack points.

00:10:34.240 --> 00:10:34.950
What?

00:10:35.300 --> 00:10:37.510
Destroy Magical Android!

00:10:55.210 --> 00:10:58.050
What was that impact?

00:10:58.880 --> 00:11:01.560
It's more powerful than our psychic duels.

00:11:02.040 --> 00:11:05.210
What's wrong?  You don't look well.

00:11:06.080 --> 00:11:08.480
That's not enough to defeat me.

00:11:09.270 --> 00:11:11.980
I'm still allowed to attack.

00:11:11.980 --> 00:11:15.330
Fortune Lady Fire, attack him directly!

00:11:22.880 --> 00:11:26.740
I set one card and end my turn.

00:11:28.120 --> 00:11:34.500
I forgot to tell you that according to my 
deck's fortune-telling, your destiny is death.

00:11:52.920 --> 00:11:58.530
What's taking so long?  Hurry up and show 
the satellite images on the monitor!

00:12:03.050 --> 00:12:05.390
What is that, Director Godwin?

00:12:05.950 --> 00:12:11.080
Unbelievable.  There's 
a geoglyph in our city.

00:12:11.500 --> 00:12:16.610
That means a Dark Signer 
is in Neo Domino City!

00:12:19.510 --> 00:12:22.160
Divine!

00:12:22.780 --> 00:12:25.730
Divine!  Where are you, Divine?

00:12:26.150 --> 00:12:30.960
Sorry, but I can't let you see Divine.

00:12:34.980 --> 00:12:37.480
Aren't you Misty?

00:12:38.300 --> 00:12:40.720
I'm happy that you know who I am.

00:12:41.120 --> 00:12:48.190
I know a lot about you too, Aki Izayoi.  
Sorry, I meant to say Black Rose Witch.

00:12:50.240 --> 00:12:55.100
You cannot escape from my revenge.

00:12:55.630 --> 00:12:59.620
Revenge?  What are you talking about?

00:12:59.990 --> 00:13:00.950
It's fine.

00:13:01.640 --> 00:13:04.910
I never expected you to tell the truth.

00:13:05.520 --> 00:13:08.610
No matter what you say, 
he's never coming back.

00:13:09.080 --> 00:13:12.890
However, I want to honor him.

00:13:12.890 --> 00:13:15.700
You're going to meet him!

00:13:16.050 --> 00:13:17.670
Who are you?

00:13:18.890 --> 00:13:20.410
A Dark Signer.

00:13:21.310 --> 00:13:22.930
Dark Signer?

00:13:24.480 --> 00:13:27.160
It's our destiny to battle.

00:13:27.960 --> 00:13:33.120
By accepting that destiny, I 
gained the power of revenge.

00:13:33.990 --> 00:13:37.020
After five thousand years, 
the seal has broken.

00:13:37.290 --> 00:13:42.130
The only thing left to do is battle 
until your team or my team is defeated!

00:13:42.420 --> 00:13:43.830
What are you talking about?

00:13:51.380 --> 00:13:52.390
What's this?

00:14:01.000 --> 00:14:02.810
Dark Signer…

00:14:07.410 --> 00:14:10.070
What?  Another earthquake?

00:14:25.270 --> 00:14:26.070
What?

00:14:41.490 --> 00:14:42.930
What is that?

00:14:56.210 --> 00:14:59.880
Another new geoglyph.

00:15:08.200 --> 00:15:09.430
What's this?

00:15:17.880 --> 00:15:23.360
Has a battle against a Dark 
Signer started in the City?

00:15:23.990 --> 00:15:25.990
I feel it.

00:15:26.570 --> 00:15:31.680
Someone with the mark of the Crimson 
Dragon is about to begin a duel!

00:15:32.870 --> 00:15:33.830
It's over there!

00:15:50.950 --> 00:15:53.630
Dammit, what's happening?

00:15:54.110 --> 00:15:57.460
Such bad timing.  I'm right in the 
middle of a prisoner transfer.

00:16:03.680 --> 00:16:05.380
Grandpa, are you okay?

00:16:05.840 --> 00:16:07.560
Yeah, I'm fine.

00:16:07.910 --> 00:16:10.650
Was that an aftershock?

00:16:10.650 --> 00:16:14.690
I don't know, but it was a good thing for us.

00:16:17.130 --> 00:16:19.180
It might now open.

00:16:24.710 --> 00:16:26.490
Well done, Himuro!

00:16:26.860 --> 00:16:29.870
Grandpa, we have to find Luca and Lua!

00:16:33.780 --> 00:16:37.070
I came to destroy Arcadia Movement.

00:16:37.760 --> 00:16:41.060
Your only remaining path is to battle me.

00:16:41.190 --> 00:16:42.440
Fine.

00:16:42.440 --> 00:16:47.040
I don't know why you hate me, 
but I'll be your opponent.

00:16:52.730 --> 00:16:55.180
This is my home.

00:16:55.760 --> 00:17:00.200
If you're going to try to destroy 
this place, then I must battle you.

00:17:08.010 --> 00:17:08.840
Duel!

00:17:10.570 --> 00:17:11.870
My turn.

00:17:12.220 --> 00:17:14.470
I summon Twilight Rose Knight.

00:17:18.830 --> 00:17:21.440
Twilight Rose Knight's effect activates.

00:17:21.440 --> 00:17:24.920
When this card is summoned, 
I can Special Summon

00:17:24.920 --> 00:17:28.620
a Level 4-or-below Plant-Type 
monster from my hand.

00:17:28.860 --> 00:17:31.120
Appear, Lord Poison!

00:17:34.440 --> 00:17:39.140
Level 3 Twilight Rose Knight 
tunes Level 4 Lord Poison!

00:17:43.000 --> 00:17:48.550
The cold flame envelops the entire 
world.  Black flower, bloom!

00:17:49.590 --> 00:17:50.950
Synchro Summon!

00:17:51.450 --> 00:17:54.560
Appear, Black Rose Dragon!

00:17:58.260 --> 00:17:59.990
Black Rose Dragon.

00:18:00.360 --> 00:18:04.960
Aki Izayoi, this proves that you're a Signer.

00:18:08.090 --> 00:18:10.190
Hang in there, Misty!

00:18:10.190 --> 00:18:12.130
You're fine!  You'll be okay!

00:18:12.130 --> 00:18:13.840
Stay strong!

00:18:13.840 --> 00:18:18.430
At that time, I didn't know 
why my life was saved.

00:18:23.910 --> 00:18:26.430
However, something entered my body back then.

00:18:26.430 --> 00:18:29.360
It whispers to me from the inside.

00:18:29.360 --> 00:18:33.370
It tells me to kill the Black Rose, 
the servant of the Crimson Dragon.

00:18:34.040 --> 00:18:36.510
I set three cards.

00:18:36.510 --> 00:18:37.840
I end my turn.

00:18:39.010 --> 00:18:40.390
My turn.

00:18:42.520 --> 00:18:46.320
From my hand, I activate the 
Field Spell Savage Colosseum.

00:18:49.640 --> 00:18:55.330
As long as I have this card, all monsters 
in attack position must attack.

00:18:55.780 --> 00:19:01.900
For every monster that battles, 
the player gains 300 life points.

00:19:02.300 --> 00:19:05.510
I activate another Continuous Spell!

00:19:07.320 --> 00:19:10.870
Due to Field Barrier's 
effect, a Field Spell cannot

00:19:10.870 --> 00:19:14.870
be destroyed nor can a new 
Field Spell be activated!

00:19:15.510 --> 00:19:18.030
A card that protects Field Spells?

00:19:19.600 --> 00:19:22.100
I summon Reptilianne Gorgon!

00:19:27.150 --> 00:19:31.060
Next, I play the Equip Spell 
Attack Pheromones from my hand.

00:19:31.090 --> 00:19:35.540
When the monster equipped 
with this card attacks

00:19:35.540 --> 00:19:39.540
your monster, your monster 
switches to attack position.

00:19:39.540 --> 00:19:42.760
I equip this card on Reptilianne Gorgon!

00:19:48.550 --> 00:19:53.280
Then I activate another Equip Spell 
from my hand.  Molting Escape!

00:19:54.080 --> 00:20:00.650
Once per turn, the Reptile-Type monster 
equipped with this card won't be destroyed in battle.

00:20:01.290 --> 00:20:06.600
And when I use this effect, the equipped 
monster's attack points increase by 100 points.

00:20:07.160 --> 00:20:10.540
Reptilianne Gorgon!  
Attack Black Rose Dragon!

00:20:11.630 --> 00:20:15.680
Why?  Black Rose Dragon has 
2400 attack points, and you're

00:20:15.680 --> 00:20:19.680
attacking with a monster with 1400 
attack points.  That's suicide!

00:20:20.270 --> 00:20:21.750
Poison Glance!

00:20:34.120 --> 00:20:38.690
Due to Molting Escape's 
effect, once per turn, the

00:20:38.690 --> 00:20:43.690
Reptile-Type monster isn't destroyed 
in battle and gains 100 attack points!

00:20:45.520 --> 00:20:49.770
Did she attack in order to increase 
her monster's attack points?

00:20:50.170 --> 00:20:52.250
No, that can't be it.

00:20:52.670 --> 00:20:56.260
Black Rose Dragon is now sealed away.

00:20:56.680 --> 00:20:58.040
Sealed away?

00:21:04.370 --> 00:21:06.840
Black Rose Dragon turned into stone!

00:21:07.320 --> 00:21:12.620
Due to Reptilianne Gorgon's 
effect, the attack points of your

00:21:12.620 --> 00:21:18.220
monster that battled it become zero, 
and it cannot change battle position.

00:21:18.480 --> 00:21:19.680
What?

00:21:22.420 --> 00:21:26.590
The Field Spell Savage 
Colosseum's effect activates!

00:21:27.570 --> 00:21:33.260
For every monster that battled, 
the player gains 300 life points.

00:21:34.380 --> 00:21:39.640
Everyone that battles against Reptilianne 
Gorgon turns into stone and crumbles.

00:21:40.230 --> 00:21:44.770
Will you be able to survive, Aki Izayoi?

00:21:44.770 --> 00:21:48.470
I will protect my home!

00:21:48.470 --> 00:21:51.260
I understand.  But can you do it?

00:21:51.660 --> 00:21:56.150
Your mentor Divine will soon be gone.

00:21:56.150 --> 00:21:57.270
What?

00:22:13.200 --> 00:22:17.670
We look up and vow towards the shining light

00:22:18.030 --> 00:22:22.740
We will build our own future

00:22:23.210 --> 00:22:28.180
The far dawn shines blindingly

00:22:28.640 --> 00:22:33.350
Awaken in the wonderland

00:22:38.950 --> 00:22:48.490
The overflowing wave of emotions approaches

00:22:48.930 --> 00:22:54.070
This world can’t be solved using algorithms

00:22:54.130 --> 00:22:58.770
Even if it loses its light

00:22:59.240 --> 00:23:04.040
The hourglass behind the 
heart can’t be turned

00:23:04.040 --> 00:23:08.510
Roll the dice and get 
out and follow the light

00:23:08.710 --> 00:23:14.090
Fly towards tomorrow faster than a heartbeat

00:23:14.220 --> 00:23:18.900
This journey has no end

00:23:19.190 --> 00:23:24.430
There’s no meaning 
because there are no tears

00:23:24.860 --> 00:23:29.670
Hear my voice
